var e="# Keyboard shortcuts\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n| --- | --- |\n| `Ctrl + Shift + N` | New project |\n| `Ctrl + Shift + O` | Open project |\n| `Ctrl + S` | Save |\n| `Ctrl + Z` / `Ctrl + Y` | Undo / Redo |\n| `Ctrl + F` / `Ctrl + H` | Search / Replace |\n| `Ctrl + G` | Go to line |\n| `Ctrl + /` | Comment line |\n| `Ctrl + E` | Show console |\n| `Ctrl + Shift + + / - / 0` | Window zoom |\n| `Ctrl + Alt + + / - / 0` | Editor zoom |\n\nCustomize the display from the **Help** menu: editor font, interface language and Typst documentation.\n\nTo review this tutorial at any time: **Help** > **Open tutorial** menu.";export{e as default};